Cell["\<\
1. Doing Chi square fits to UGC7321 data and getting the halo parameters and \
then doing the Chi-square fit for the same and obtaining the range of allowed \
halo parameters
2. Doing the chi-square fitting for 10% and 15%
3. similar tests for other galaxies given in deBlok paper.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7071208757669077`*^9, 3.7071208990361853`*^9}, {
  3.707121016684223*^9, 3.707121022373193*^9}, {3.7071211267455387`*^9, 
  3.707121160640793*^9}, {3.7071213501319847`*^9, 3.707121377683934*^9}, {
  3.707121457000711*^9, 3.707121485849862*^9}}]
}, Closed]],

